    "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">a popular, self-fertile European prune-plum varietyknown for producing sweet, dark blue-purple oval fruits with golden-yellow flesh. </span></p><ul class=\"lexical-text-editor--list-ul\"><li value=\"1\"><b><strong class=\"lexical-text-editor--bold\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Flavor:</strong></b><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"> Very sweet and rich.</span></li><li value=\"2\"><b><strong class=\"lexical-text-editor--bold\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Color:</strong></b><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"> Deep blue-purple skin with golden-yellow flesh.</span></li><li value=\"3\"><b><strong class=\"lexical-text-editor--bold\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Uses:</strong></b><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"> Great for fresh eating, baking, canning, and drying into prunes.</span></li></ul>",
